cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these transcriptions, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
title: "Latvian books in Fraktur: diplomatic transcriptions"
abstract: >-
  Diplomatic transcriptions of Latvian books printed in Fraktur in the orthography
  before the reform of the 1920s, re-OCRed from the scans and corrected by hand
  against them, word by word: Kārlis Skalbe, Latvju dainu izlase III, Kā es braucu
  Ziemeļmeitas lūkoties, Pazemīgas dvēseles (1911) and Sapņi un teikas (1912);
  Kārlis Hūgenbergers, Leelajs Kristaps jeb Kristus-nessejs (1850).
authors:
  - name: "just-a-book-archivist"
repository-code: "https://github.com/just-a-book-archivist/latvian-fraktur-books"
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
keywords:
  - Latvian
  - Fraktur
  - old orthography
  - diplomatic transcription
  - Kārlis Skalbe
  - dainas
